11/1（日）～12/6（日）🐡\n「#三陸・常磐ウィークス （第６弾）」を実施！\n\n三陸・常磐地域の水産業等の復興を後押しするため、官民連携の枠組み「魅力発見！三陸・常磐ものネットワーク」の取組として、弁当の購入やキッチンカー・社食等の利用を通じた三陸・常磐ものの消費拡大を実施します。 https://t.co/kDTAp9nPcl","id_str":"2116135336481046814","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"266566401"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[19,30],"text":"三陸・常磐ウィークス"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"meti.go.jp/press/2026/10/…","expanded_url":"https://www.meti.go.jp/press/2026/10/20261030004.html","indices":[178,201],"url":"https://t.co/Z4izwLVejz"},{"display_url":"sjm-network.jp","expanded_url":"https://sjm-network.jp/","indices":[229,252],"url":"https://t.co/j7n32Jbsao"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMTYxMzUzMzYzNTUyODcwNDA=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"🐟11/1（日）～12/6（日）🐡\n「#三陸・常磐ウィークス （第６弾）」を実施！\n\n三陸・常磐地域の水産業等の復興を後押しするため、官民連携の枠組み「魅力発見！三陸・常磐ものネットワーク」の取組として、弁当の購入やキッチンカー・社食等の利用を通じた三陸・常磐ものの消費拡大を実施します。\n \n👇「三陸・常磐ウィークス（第６弾）」についての詳細はこちら \nhttps://t.co/Z4izwLVejz\n👇三陸・常磐ものネットワークについての詳細はこちら🐟\nhttps://t.co/j7n32Jbsao"}}},"rest_id":"2116135336481046814","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"6559","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2116135336481046814","sortIndex":"2117211366325485402"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"rest_id":"https://t.co/LIwCpLZbK0"},"cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":295},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"